            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This is the final article in a six-part series that has highlighted how a range of factors can affect patients' experience of pain. The series closes with a consideration of how evaluation of pain management can help, raise awareness of such issues and lead to improvement in the quality of care.</AbstractText>
